WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:12.600
Rate cards: rate cards: zones, weight bands, volumetric weight, service levels and surcharges. The assistant uses them for instant quotes in DMs.

2
00:00:13.151 --> 00:00:17.350
Click "New rate card" and build the zones with "Add zone".

3
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:24.480
Under "Weight bands", price each weight; a row without a weight means each extra kg.

4
00:00:25.026 --> 00:00:30.820
Set the "Surcharges" (fuel, insurance, fragile, remote area).

5
00:00:31.368 --> 00:00:35.650
Try a route and weight in the "Quote tester" and click "Calculate".

6
00:00:36.196 --> 00:00:42.220
Without a rate card, instant quotes in DMs don't work and every question reaches the team.
